    "created_at": "2024-01-29T15:45:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-01-29T15:45:36Z",
    "body": "What about adding a value to the autoplay attribute? `autoplay=\"inView\"` which would follow the preload guidance as already specified, but would not play until it entered the viewport.",
